vacy_link} and {cookies_link}.\",\"link.info.data_encryption\":\"Data encryption\",\"link.info.data_encryption.description\":\"Your card information stays secure with data encryption on servers that meet the highest PCI standards available in the payment industry.\",\"link.info.headline\":\"{businessName} uses <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> to securely save your payment information.\",\"link.info.byline\":\"<linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> saves your contact information, payment details, and shipping addresses to autofill for future purchases on <linkBrand>Link</linkBrand>-supported sites.\",\"link.info.byline.v2\":\"<linkBrand>Link</linkBrand> saves your contact information, payment details, and shipping addresses so you can pay faster next time.\",\"link.info.mobile_verification\":\"Mobile verification\",\"link.info.mobile_verification.description\":\"You’re protected with mobile authentication designed to ensure that you’re the only person who can access your information.\",\"link.info.notice\":\"You can review every order before you pay.\",\"link.info.privacy\":\"Privacy Policy\",\"link.info.privacy.v2\":\"privacy\",\"link.info.privacy_link\":\"Learn more about privacy\",\"link.instant_debits.financial_incentive.explain_incentive\":\"Get {financialIncentive} back when you pay by bank.\",\"link.instant_debits.financial_incentive.explain_incentive_percent\":\"Get {formattedPercent} of your purchase back when you pay by bank.\",\"link.instant_debits.financial_incentive.explain_incentive_setup_intents\":\"Get {financialIncentive} when you pay for the first time with your bank.\",\"link.instant_debits.financial_incentive.explain_incentive_setup_intents_short\":\"{financialIncentive} back on a qualifying purchase when you pay by bank.\",\"link.instant_debits.financial_incentive.explain_incentive_short\":\"{financialIncentive} back when you pay by bank.\",\"link.instant_debits.financial_incentive.ineligible\":\"This bank account is ineligible for promotions.\",\"link.instant_d